    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Kqy481bgNHojXv9S1ntJSPHoNaoWw8NXfkSJNAPdBqg.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& P_1=P_0+\\rho g h=P_0+1000 \\times 10 \\times \\frac{20}{100} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow P_1=P_0+2000\n\\end{aligned}$\nSo, $P_2-P_1=\\frac{2 S}{R}=\\left(\\frac{2 S}{1 \\times 10^{-3}}\\right)$\n$\\Rightarrow P_2=P_0+2100$\n(given)\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { So, } P_0+2100-P_0-2000=2 S \\times 10^3 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 100=2 S \\times 10^3 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow s=\\left(\\frac{1}{20}\\right)=0.05\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
